{
  "id": "1SA.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samueli 10",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Samueli achihala chitupa cha mafuha, achigamwaga chitswani pha Sauli, achimdonera achimuamba, “Mwenyezi Mlungu akakutiya mafuha [ukale mtawala wa atue Iziraeli. Uwe undaatawala atu a Mwenyezi Mlungu na kuaokola kula kpwa aviha ao. Na hino ndiyo ndokala dalili kpwako ya kpwamba Mwenyezi Mlungu akakutiya mafuha]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maneno higa, garigoikpwa kpwenye mabano, gaandikpwa kahi za nakala ya Chilagane cha kare cha Chiyunani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ukale mtawala wa atue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiphorichana rero, uyakutana na alume airi phephi na mbira ya Raheli, kpwenye mphaka wa tsi ya Benjamini hiko Selisa, nao andakuambira, ‘Hinyo punda uriokpwendaaendza aphahikana kare, naye sowe wayala habari za nyo punda ela vivi ana wasiwasi dzulu yenu. Iye anadziuza, “Nindahendadze mino hata nimuone mwanangu?” ’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Chisha uchila hipho, undaphiya mbere na ndiphofika kpwenye mwaloni wa Tabori, undakutana na atu ahahu ambao anaambuka kpwendamlavira Mlungu sadaka hiko Betheli. Mmwenga andakala ana mbuzi tahu, wanjina anatsukula mikahe mihahu na ye wa hahu anatsukula chiriba cha uchi wa zabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu aho andakulamusa na akuphe mikahe miiri nawe undaiphokera kula mwao mikononi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya hipho phiya Gibeya ya Mlungu, kuko kuriko na ngome ya Afilisti. Hipho ndiphokala u phephi na kuufikira mudzi, undakutana na kundi ra manabii anatserera kula phatu pha dzulu pha kulavira sadaka kuno anatabiri. Mbere zao kundakala na apigadzi ngephephe, tamburini, vivoti na zeze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Roho wa Mwenyezi Mlungu andakpwedzera kpwa nguvu nawe undatabiri phamwenga nao nawe undageluzwa kukala mutu tafwauti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, hipho ishara zizi zichihendeka, henda kama uonavyo ni sawa kpwa kukala Mlungu a phamwenga nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe undanitanguliya kuphiya hadi Giligali nami, lola, ndakpwedza kuko ili kulavya sadaka za kuochwa na kutsindza sadaka za amani. Undagodza siku sabaa hadi ndiphofika, nkuonyese ulondwago uhende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Sauli ariphogaluka kurichana Samueli, Mlungu achimgaluza moyowe, nazo dalili hizo zosi zichihendeka siku iyo-iyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ariphofika Gibeya, wakutana na chikundi cha manabii. Chisha roho wa Mlungu achimwedzera kpwa nguvu naye achitabiri kahi-kahi zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi ariokala anammanya ariphoona dzambo hiro, kukala anatabiri phamwenga na manabii, ndipho atu achiuzana, “Ni utu wani huno uchiomphaha mwana wa Kishi? Dze! Sauli piya ni mmwengawapho wa manabii?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.19.23+1SA.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 19:23–24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu mmwenga ariyeishi phatu hipho wauza, achiaamba, “Na ise yao ni ani?” Kpwa iyo uchikala msemo, “Dze! Sauli piya ni mmwengawapho wa manabii?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ariphomala kutabiri, waambuka kuphiya pho phatu pha dzulu pha kulavira sadaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ise mdide achimuuza Sauli na mtumishiwe, “Dze! Mwino kala mkaphiyaphi?” Naye Sauli wajibu achiamba, “Swino kala huchaendza hinyo punda na huriphoona kukala taaoneka, huaphiya kpwa Samueli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ise mdide wa Sauli achiamba, “Nakuvoya uniambire, ye Samueli wakuambirani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli wamjibu ise mdide, achimuamba, “Wahuambira chingʼangʼa kukala hinyo punda akaoneka kare.” Ela kamuambirire kukala Samueli akamuamba andakala mfalume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Samueli waakusanya Aiziraeli mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu hiko Mizipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiambira, “Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli, anaamba hivi, ‘Nakutuluzani kula Misiri nami nchikuokolani mwimwi kula mikononi mwa Amisiri na kula kpwa falume zosi zirizokuonerani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela rero mkamrema Mlungu wenu anayekutivyani na shida zenu zosi na mateso genu gosi; namwi mkamuambira, “Hata, huikire mutu ndiyehutawala.” Sambi, kusanyikani mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, kulengana na mbari zenu na miryango yenu.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Samueli achireha phephi mbari zosi za Iziraeli nayo mbari ya Benjamini ichitsambulwa kpwa kupigirwa kura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achireha phephi mbari ya Benjamini kulengana na miryango yao; nao mryango wa Matiri uchitsambulwa. Achiireha phephi mryango wa Matiri, mutu bada ya mutu na Sauli, mwana wa Kishi achitsambulwa, ela ariphomuendza taayamuona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi aenderera kumuuza Mwenyezi Mlungu, “Dze phana mutu wanjina ambaye kadzangbwefika?” Naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiajibu achiaamba, “Lola, akadzifwitsa pho phenye mizigo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi aphiya hiko mara mwenga achendamuhala; naye ariphoima kahi-kahi ya atu kala ni mure hata atu osi kala akamfika mafuzini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli waambira atu osi, “Mnamuona mutu yuno ariyetsambulwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu, ya kukala takuna mutu mfwanowe kahi za atu osi.” Ndipho atu osi achikota kululu achiamba, “Mfalume na akale na maisha mare!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Samueli waambira atu shariya na haki ya mfalume, achigaandika katika chitabu, achichiika mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. Samueli waabumula atu osi na chila mmwenga achiuya kpwakpwe kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
