              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela anjina asiofwaha chitu achiamba, “Andahutivyadze yuno?” Nao amnema, na taayamrehera zawadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.27",
